vyatta-service-ntp (0.24) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Port to ntpsec (Debian 13 has no ntp package): depend on ntpsec and
    ntpsec-ntpdate; the default instance's configuration is linked at
    /etc/ntpsec/ntp.conf and runs as ntpsec.service; the drop-in moves to
    ntpsec.service.d; drift file and statistics move to ntpsec's
    /var/lib/ntpsec and /var/log/ntpsec; hide ntpsec-ntpdate's if-up and
    dhclient hooks; "show ntp packets" drops the private statistics, which
    ntpsec's ntpq does not have.

 -- NuDanOS Maintainers <jon@fernandez.tech>  Fri, 02 Oct 2026 08:46:18 -0700

